 "note": "Pinout: sn74hc541 p.3 Pin Functions (OE1=1, A1-A8=2-9, GND=10, Y8-Y1=11-18, OE2=19, VCC=20); same positions in sn74ahc541 p.3, sn74ahct541 p.3 (J/W/FK too), sn74lvc541a p.3-4 (RKS/RGY same numbering), sn74ac541 p.3 (DGS, RKS), sn74hcs541 p.3, sn74lv541a p.3 (DB/DGV/DW/NS/PW/DGS, RGY/RKS), sn74abt541b p.1 (J/W/DB/DW/N/PW, FK), sn74lvth541, sn74als541, sn74bct541a, sn74f541, sn74ls541 p.1 (FK same numbering), cd74fct541 p.1. 20-pin FK LCCC uses the same 1-20 numbering (no NC). Names differ only by datasheet style at the same positions: CD74HC/HCT541 and CD54/74AC/ACT541 print OE1, A0-A7, Y0-Y7, OE2 (cd74hc541 p.3 figure, cd74ac541 p.3 figure; the cd74ac541 Pin Functions table p.3 is a copy of a '273 table and is wrong); CY54/74FCT541T prints OEA, D0-D7, OEB, O0-O7 (cy74fct541t p.1); SN54/74LS541 prints G1, G2 (sn74ls541 p.1). Merged under the SN names (A1-A8/Y1-Y8). Function table (sn74hc541, cd74fct541 p.1): OE1 L and OE2 L -> Y = A; either OE high -> Z.",
